<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lincoln National upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lincoln National upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded Lincoln National Corp to intermediate-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- said kept the long-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, Lincoln Nation agreed to acquire CIGNA Corp's individual life insurance and annuity business for $1.4 billion in cash.</p>
<p>-- Lincoln National gained 1/2 to 67-1/2.</p>
</text>
